        "native_id": 12255,
        "number_of_reviews": 1,
        "owner_reply": "Hello,\nThank you for sharing your feedback. We're truly sorry to hear about your experience. We understand how frustrating it must have been to wait so long for your order, have difficulty with the fit, struggle with the return process, receive more emails than expected, and experience issues managing your account.\nOur team has already reached out to you via email regarding this matter so we can assist you further and work toward the best possible solution. Please kindly check your inbox (including your spam/junk folder) and reply to our email at your convenience.\nThank you for your patience and for giving us the opportunity to make things right.",
        "owner_reply_date": "2026-07-22T05:29:29Z",
        "owner_reply_updated_date": null,
        "page_number": 8,
        "rating_value": 2,
        "report": null,
        "review_body": "I did not enjoy the items and then struggled being able to return them. Additionally I tried to delete a secondary account because after I signed in, I realized that I had made a different account on my phone that was attached to the order. I understand why it took so long for the items to come, but it was 2 months. For two pairs of pants. That is too long. The pants don't actually fit that well and they were very dependent on the body you have in order to look good. My experience after purchase has been awful getting up to two emails a day despite it being stated on the bottom of the email that it was the last email regarding viewing. I did talk to customer service. No the bot nor the human were able to help me and said I should call or email. The email was not replied to either. No I don't care to resolve anything further. I will not complain about the clothes to others either because that happens being a woman and buying pants. I will complain about amount of emails and the lack of actually being able to delete your account. I had a truly not good experience and I am sorry for wasting so much money, time, and effort on it. ",
        "review_headline": "I did not enjoy the items and then…",
